title: 'pallet-asset-conversion: return the whole credit when a credit swap fails'

doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `SwapCredit::swap_tokens_for_exact_tokens` now returns the full input credit on failure.

    Before, the pallet split the input into the swap amount and the change. If the swap then
    failed, only the swap amount came back. The change was dropped inside the transaction that
    was rolled back right after, so its issuance decrease was undone while the credit itself was
    gone. The caller lost the change and total issuance ended up above the sum of balances.

    No public API changes.

crates:
- name: pallet-asset-conversion
  bump: patch
